      "preview": "מִדְיָן: nome próprio masculino: Midiã; tribo e território.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיָן</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  filho de Abraão e Quetura <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:2\" href=\"/Genesis.25.2\">Gn 25.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:4\" href=\"/Genesis.25.4\">Gn 25.4</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.32\">1Cr 1.32</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.33\">1Cr 1.33</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  uma tribo árabe <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:35\" href=\"/Genesis.36.35\">Gn 36.35</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.46\">1Cr 1.46</a>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:3\" href=\"/Numbers.31.3\">Nm 31.3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:7\" href=\"/Numbers.31.7\">Nm 31.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">Nm 31.8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:9\" href=\"/Numbers.31.9\">Nm 31.9</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Judges 6-9\" href=\"/Judges.6-9\">Jz 6–9</a> (31 vezes); tendo um <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּהֵן</span> (como chefe?) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:16\" href=\"/Exodus.2.16\">Êx 2.16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:1\" href=\"/Exodus.3.1\">Êx 3.1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:1\" href=\"/Exodus.18.1\">Êx 18.1</a> (E); <span dir=\"rtl\">זקנים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:4\" href=\"/Numbers.22.4\">Nm 22.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:7\" href=\"/Numbers.22.7\">Nm 22.7</a> (JE), <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂיא(ים)</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:18\" href=\"/Numbers.25.18\">Nm 25.18</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:21\" href=\"/Joshua.13.21\">Js 13.21</a> (P), <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:25\" href=\"/Judges.7.25\">Jz 7.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:3\" href=\"/Judges.8.3\">Jz 8.3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מלכים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">Nm 31.8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:5\" href=\"/Judges.5.5\">Jz 5.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:12\" href=\"/Judges.5.12\">Jz 5.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:26\" href=\"/Judges.5.26\">Jz 5.26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכְרֵי מִדְיָן</span> <em>dromedários de Midiã</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.6\">Is 60.6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם מִדְיָן</span> <em>dia de Midiã</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.3\">Is 9.3</a> (a vitória sobre Midiã <a data-ref=\"Judges 7-8\" href=\"/Judges.7-8\">Jz 7–8</a>) cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.26\">Is 10.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:10\" href=\"/Psalms.83.10\">Sl 83.10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ מִדְיָן</span> <em>a terra de Midiã</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:15\" href=\"/Exodus.2.15\">Êx 2.15</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:7\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.7\">Hc 3.7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:19\" href=\"/Exodus.4.19\">Êx 4.19</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:15\" href=\"/Numbers.25.15\">Nm 25.15</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.18\">1Rs 11.18</a>; terra do golfo elanítico (onde os geógrafos árabes ainda situam a cidade <span dir=\"rtl\">مدين</span>). Cf. sobre Midiã, Glaser<sup>Skizze ii. 447 ff.</sup>; Hom<sup>Aufsätze i. (1892), 4 f.</sup>",
