      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong><em>Yah(u) tirou</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָהוּ</span>, <strong>a.</strong>  um sacerdote, contemporâneo de Davi, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.18\">1Cr 24.18</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  um príncipe de Judá, contemporâneo de Jeremias <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.12\">Jr 36.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.25\">Jr 36.25</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּלָיָה</span>, <strong>a.</strong>  chefe de uma família contemporânea de Zorobabel <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:60\" href=\"/Ezra.2.60\">Ed 2.60</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:61\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.61\">Ne 7.61</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  descendente de Zorobabel <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.24\">1Cr 3.24</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  pai de um contemporâneo de <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.10\">Ne 6.10</a>.",
